WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-GB

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:02.460
Hi I'm Sam from BBC Learning English

00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:05.620
and this is me in class.

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:12.500
How am I feeling -

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:14.600
bored or boring?

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:17.200
I was feeling bored

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:20.200
because the lesson was boring.

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:23.780
So the lesson was the reason I felt bored.

00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:27.740
So –ed endings describe the feeling

00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:30.900
and –ing endings describe the reason

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:32.800
you have that feeling.

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:35.280
And this works for other adjectives too.

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:38.860
So if the lesson is interesting, I feel interested.

00:00:38.860 --> 00:00:41.720
If something is tiring, I'm tired.

00:00:41.720 --> 00:00:44.200
If something is relaxing, I'm relaxed.

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:46.720
If something is surprising, I'm surprised.

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:49.680
If something is exciting, I'm excited.

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:53.180
So, tell us how these videos make you feel.

